      "level": "avoid",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: شیردهی توصیه نمی‌شود یا باید بین دارو و شیردهی یکی انتخاب شود.",
        "en": "Label: breastfeeding not recommended, or choose between the drug and breastfeeding."
      },
      "quote": "Because of the potential for serious adverse reactions in breastfed infants, advise women not to breastfeed during treatment with SUTENT and for at least 4 weeks after the last dose.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-sutent",
          "section": "8.2"
